Fast BJT preamplifier
VCC vcc 0 12
VIN src 0 AC 1m
CIN src base 1u
R1 vcc base 100k
R2 base 0 22k
RC vcc collector 1k
RE emitter 0 220
Q1 collector base emitter QSI
.MODEL QSI NPN (IS=1e-15 BF=100 VAF=80 CJE=5p CJC=3p TF=0.3n)
.OP
.AC DEC 20 10 100MEG
.MEASURE AC GAIN_DB_1K FIND DB(V(collector)) AT=1K
.PROBE V(*) I(*)
.END
